# Embedding binaries now committed to the repo:
#   *.bin and *.json — committed normally (each <15 MB)
#   *.onnx           — tracked via Git LFS (see ../.gitattributes); the
#                      multilingual-e5-small int8 export is 113 MB, over
#                      GitHub's 100 MB per-file non-LFS limit.
# Regen workflow: regenerate on Windows host with
#   python parse_corpus.py <langs> && python generate_embeddings.py <langs>
# then copy embedding/output/*.{bin,json} (and any updated *.onnx) here and
# commit. LFS-tracked files push to the LFS server automatically.
